{"id":"u-68418334-9171-4026-80a9-0115d11608db","src":"community","title":"BIG Booty Baddiez","author":"Desmond  D.","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/ACwth9-big-booty-baddies","desc":"The purpose of Big Booty Baddies is to give women a science-backed, glute-and-quad focused training plan that builds:\n\n🍑 A rounder, fuller, lifted butt through proven hip thrust, squat, lunge, and hinge variations.\n\n🦵 Thicker, luscious thighs for balance and lower body strength.\n\n💪 A touch of upper body work (arms, shoulders, posture) to maintain symmetry and confidence in-case you need to pimp slap a hater.\n\n🔥 Confidence, strength, and fun with themed sessions that make training feel like an empowering experience, not just “leg day.”\n\nIt’s a 4-day hypertrophy plan, blending heavy compound lifts with high-volume isolation and burnouts, designed to keep ladies engaged while progressively overloading the glutes from every angle guaranteeing a bigger badonk and tighter waistline.","level":["Beginner","Intermediate"],"goals":["Women's","Muscle"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":50,"joins":47,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-11-03T12:18:59.655Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Apple Bottom Pump","Badonk Builders","Thick Thigh Therapy","Bubble Booty Blueprint"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Squat (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":8,"rpe":9,"x":4}]},{"n":"Hip Thrust (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":10,"rpe":9,"x":4}]},{"n":"Walking Lunge (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":12,"rpe":9,"x":3}]},{"n":"Hip Adductor (Machine)","sets":[{"lo":15,"hi":20,"rpe":9,"x":3}]},{"n":"Back Extension","sets":[{"lo":12,"hi":15,"rpe":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Seated Row (Cable)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":10,"rpe":7,"x":3}]},{"n":"Lat Pulldown","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":10,"rpe":7,"x":3}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Squat (Smith Machine)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":10,"rpe":9,"x":4}]},{"n":"Romanian Deadlift (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":10,"rpe":9,"x":4}]},{"n":"Single Leg Hip Thrust","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":12,"rpe":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"G